 "title": "She didn't show. I left one last note. Part 6",
 "note": "Season finale. Recap: part 5's vote (A come back next thursday / B leave one last note), A first. A: he goes home at 9:41 and comes back three Thursdays in a row with the sock, a cobweb grows on him; he never left a note, so she never knew. Rewind. B: he stays to write one last note; it takes him 20 minutes (drafts pile up on dryer 4, the clock runs 9:40 to 10:00). The note goes on dryer 5 with the sock: 'no pressure. thank you for every note.' At 10:02 the door flies open: Nora, out of breath, in the pink tee. On the back of his note: 'so sorry I'm late! my bus broke down. I ran the rest. - Nora, right here'. First words out loud: 'hi, Nora.' 'hi, Leo.' She holds up the sock. One dryer this time. End card: the end, thanks for every A and B. No vote, no NoSwipe mention. All times in seconds.",
